    {
      "id": "u_90d8156c27419a2b32ae6550_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Options when using sync__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "90d8156c27419a2b32ae655073aed6ec747db2bbad5d336f5a50b4d0dc12ebbe",
      "context": "Options > Options when using sync",
      "contextHash": "0d7c8183535aca3773937832ca5bb73d64ea0c54a122277ce3e88617b46ceabb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_459a10c5a328712a1156dab5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When using __TRILIUM_PH_0__Synchronization__TRILIUM_PH_1__, some of the options will be kept in sync across all the devices while others can be changed independently.",
      "sourceHash": "459a10c5a328712a1156dab519e21618591ece7197da9052df3bb9dbe6e7b9da",
      "context": "Options > Options when using sync",
      "contextHash": "0d7c8183535aca3773937832ca5bb73d64ea0c54a122277ce3e88617b46ceabb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0201c59fe7282499ba9bfce9_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Generally, the options that relate to appearance are intentionally kept not synced in order to allow per-client customization (layout orientation, theme, vertical/horizontal layout, code block themes).",
      "sourceHash": "0201c59fe7282499ba9bfce9a443c6a0860540459f87ff382d0ff82b047c10cc",
      "context": "Options > Options when using sync",
      "contextHash": "0d7c8183535aca3773937832ca5bb73d64ea0c54a122277ce3e88617b46ceabb",
